WEBVTT

00:16:59.550 --> 00:17:02.554
from every land in the world,

00:17:02.554 --> 00:17:06.081
and it is our obligation as contributing citizens

00:17:06.081 --> 00:17:07.867
to this wonderful country of ours

00:17:07.867 --> 00:17:11.014
to make sure that no child gets left behind.

00:17:11.014 --> 00:17:13.092
Thank you very much.

00:17:13.092 --> 00:17:25.199
(Applause)